// Every piece of a line: markup, shown values, commands, pauses, speed, breaks, icons, conditional text and tags.

@actor mira
    name: Mira
@actor rex
    name: Rex

@enum mood: calm, tense

@var $name = "Sam"
@var $count = 3
@var $price = 1.50
@var $who: actor = rex
@var $key = false
@var $delay = 0s
@var $loud = 0

@command shake(strength: number = 1) inline
@command wait_for(who: actor) inline waits

@markup wave(amplitude: number = 1, frequency: number = 5)
@markup shout
@icon bag, key
@tag thought
@tag box: mood
@tag cue: string

== text.main
mira: Plain, [b]bold [i]and italic[/i][/b] and [wave amplitude=2]waving [shout]nested[/shout][/wave]. #id:t01
mira: Pause{w 0.5} then wait{w} then a page{p}and a break{br}here. #id:t02
mira: {speed 0.3}Slow{speed} normal {speed 2}fast. #id:t03
mira: Icons {icon bag} and [b]{icon key}[/b]. #id:t04
mira: {@shake 2}Shaking, {@wait_for rex}waiting, {@wait_for rex nowait}not, {@shake 3 wait}now. #id:t05
rex: {$name} has {$price} and {$count}, says {$who}. #id:t06
mira: You {if $key}have{elif $count > 1}nearly have{else}lack{/if} it. #id:t07
mira: {if $key}{w}{p}[b]yes[/b]{else}no{/if} #id:t08
mira: Ends with {$name}{w} #id:t09
rex: Tags. #thought #box:tense #cue:rex_01 #id:t10
mira: Skipped{w $delay}{speed $loud} points. #id:t11
-> A [b]bold[/b] option {icon key} #thought #id:p01
    mira: Chosen. #id:t12
-> Plain option #id:p02
